    <description>Fires when AF_RequisitionStatus__c changes to Rejected - notifies the Opportunity Owner via email (emailSimple - emailAlert core action confirmed unavailable in this org) and via Custom Notification, matching the dual-channel pattern used for Closed Lost (AF_FL_Opp_LostRejected). LFRDN-750 (2026-09-27): Send_Owner_Rejection was missing senderType/senderAddress/logEmailOnSend - unlike every other emailSimple call in this org&apos;s Opportunity flows, it had no org-wide sender configured, which is why it silently never delivered (no EmailMessage was ever logged either). Added the same OrgWideEmailAddress/logEmailOnSend pattern used by AF_FL_Opp_RequisitionApproved - confirmed live, the email now sends and logs correctly. Also added Get_ProcessInstance/Get_RejectionReason (ProcessInstanceStep.Comments for this Opportunity&apos;s approval) and included it in both the email body and the notification body, with a &quot;No reason was provided&quot; fallback - live-verified this fallback text still fires today, because the field-update action that runs this flow executes before the Approval engine&apos;s own ProcessInstanceStep audit row for that same rejection is query-visible in the triggering transaction (a real, documented Salesforce platform ordering quirk, not a bug in this flow&apos;s SOQL). The comment IS correctly present moments later on the very next query outside this transaction.

LFRDN-750 (2026-09-28): the notification now runs on the flow&apos;s asynchronous path (AsyncAfterCommit), after the approval transaction commits, so Get_RejectionReason finds the rejection step and its Comments. Entry condition is the same (status becomes Rejected), expressed as ISPICKVAL + &quot;only when updated to meet the condition&quot;, which an asynchronous path requires.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_EmailBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#F4F4F6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E2E5EA;border-top:4px solid #B3261E;padding:20px 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;background-color:#FBE4E1;color:#B3261E;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;&quot;&gt;Rejected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:12px 0;font-size:18px;color:#0B2545;&quot;&gt;Internal Requisition Form Rejected&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Your Internal Requisition Form request for &lt;strong&gt;&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &apos;&lt;/strong&gt; has been rejected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:12px;color:#6B6B6B;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;&quot;&gt;Reason&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;background:#F4F4F6;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 12px;&quot;&gt;&apos; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Get_RejectionReason.Comments}), &quot;No reason was provided.&quot;, {!Get_RejectionReason.Comments}) &amp; &apos;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Please review and resubmit if needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_Subject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Rejected: Internal Requisition Form for &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Your Internal Requisition Form request for &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot; was rejected. Reason: &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Get_RejectionReason.Comments}), &quot;No reason was provided.&quot;, {!Get_RejectionReason.Comments})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Requisition Rejected: &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
